Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, debconf (>= 0.5) | debconf-2.0
Recommends: dovecot-xaps-plugin
Description: Apple push notification daemon for Dovecot
 Receives mail events from the Dovecot XAPS plugin and sends native Apple Push
 Notification Service notifications to registered devices.
